<title>EGYPT: Suez canal earns Egypt $152.3 million in July.</title>
<headline>Suez canal earns Egypt $152.3 million in July.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's revenue from the Suez canal was $152.3 million in July, compared with $149.5 million in June and $165.8 million in July last year, the statistics department of the cabinet office said.</p>
<p>Revenue from the canal in the first seven months of the year amounted to $1,078.3 million, against $1,142.6 million in the same period of 1995, it added.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
